 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kyou de Anata wo Wasuremasu. Dakara Douzo o-shiawase ni"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "今日で貴方を忘れます。だからどうぞお幸せに"
   },
   {
    "en": "Starting today, I will forget you, so I wish you happiness."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“Until graduation, please allow me to love another woman.”\n\nWith these cruel words, the Crown Prince shattered the heart of his noble fiancée, who had loved him with unwavering devotion. Despite her pain, she tried to remain strong, upholding her dignity as the daughter of a ducal family and the future queen.\n\nBut the greatest shock wasn’t just his words—it was his actions. He openly flaunted his love for his mistress, betraying her before the eyes of everyone. Again and again, she endured the heartbreak in silence, until her heart was on the verge of breaking completely.\n\nYet love, even when painful, does not fade so easily… However, she had reached a point where she could bear no more.\n\nIn a moment of despair, she made her final decision—she would abandon her old self, even if it cost her life.\n\nA dramatic tale of love, betrayal, and rebirth, where what seemed like the end becomes the beginning of an entirely different fate!\n\n(Source: MangaUpdates)"
  },
